{"id":"vod_md_3834","vodId":"3834","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"URARA迷路帖","name_cn":"URARA迷路帖","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230831-1/1af5ece4401d90aed812f5ae66fffd7f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个名为“迷路镇”的小镇之中，在这里，居住着很多以占卜为职业的占卜师，他们被称为“Urara”。活泼可爱的少女千矢（原田彩枫 配音）千里迢迢来到迷路镇，她希望能在这里见到一直都在寻找的母亲，在这座拥有着神奇力量，因缘交汇的小镇，千矢的梦想能够化为现实呢？出生于名门茶屋的巽绀（本渡枫 配音）、含着金汤匙出生但格外平易近人的千金大小姐雪见小梅（久保由利香 配音）、胆小害羞，擅长操纵人偶的枣乃乃（佳村遥 配音），千矢在迷路镇和这三位可爱的少女相遇了，志同道合的四人一拍即合，共同朝着目的地枣屋进发。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-31 08:33:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/KIHPC0J8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/mwV3cuBX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/uwQ6nOEJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/XR3H4dMF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/Ua5RznUd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/GmeRYauD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/dZMH9zf1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/bipuoNoX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/1wbb3Jph/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/upmY0Bd1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/vOe9gaTT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/ZA3GbEw7/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:23.883Z"}